    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Water&#x27;s liquid-vapor phase boundary from the integrated Clausius-Clapeyron equation (~chemistrykit.thermo.systems.phase_equilibria.ClausiusClapeyron), anchored at the normal boiling point. Plotting \ln P against 1/T gives a straight line of slope -\Delta H_{vap}/R; from_two_points recovers \Delta H_{vap} from two measured points, and boiling_point inverts the curve to find the boiling point at altitude.">

